---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Koate Kpai and this blog.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Koate Kpai, a cloud platform and DevOps engineer focused on Google
      Cloud. This site documents production-grade GCP architecture patterns —
      Terraform, Cloud Run, GKE, SRE, security and IAM, data/MLOps, and FinOps.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every post is code-first and backed by evidence: working Terraform, real
      command output, metrics, and cost. The goal is simple: patterns you can
      actually run, not slideware.
    </p>
    <h2>How posts are organised</h2>
    <p>
      Posts live under seven pillars (A–G), each carrying a proof tier: Tier 1
      runs live infrastructure, Tier 2 proves with code, and Tier 3 is a
      reference architecture. Org-dependent topics are flagged and scheduled
      last.
    </p>
    <p>
      Subscribe via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
